OL,3,ASome veterans to be called up to test
OL,4,AUK's war resilience
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome veterans will be mobilised as part
OL,7,Fof a major exercise next year testing
OL,8,Fthe UK's resilience for war.
OL,10,FThe government exercise will challenge
OL,11,Fthe Ministry of Defence (MoD) "on a
OL,12,Fscale that we haven't seen for a very
OL,13,Flong time" on its reaction in the event
OL,14,Fof a conflict, armed forces minister
OL,15,FLouise Sandher-Jones said.
OL,17,FThe drill will involve an as-yet
OL,18,Funspecified number of the British
OL,19,Fmilitary's strategic reserve, which has
OL,20,Fan estimated 95,000 retired regular and
OL,21,Freserve officers.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
