OL,3,ASome veterans to be called up to test
OL,4,AUK's war resilience
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt forms part of a plan by the MoD for
OL,7,Fa "real step change" to use the
OL,8,Fstrategic reserve more, following
OL,9,Fwarnings of a workforce retention
OL,10,Fcrisis.
